    "sub_name": "建築設計(九)",
    "sub_ename": "ARCHITECTURAL DESIGN(9)",
    "describe_ch": "畢業設計為二學期一年的課程,第一學期鼓勵同學挑戰當今複雜的都市議題,學生個人或二人一組各自選擇自己的題目.內容則著眼于基地分析與計畫書之寫作流程,特定基地建構特定的地域特質.期末繳交設計草案與模型.",
    "describe_eh": "The studio of finac graduate architecture design work is structured two semesters. The first semester, we encourage students to challenge any issues on the complexities of comtemporary urban conditions. Student individual or group team will select their own topics. Focus on site knowledge effect programming procedvres  and specific sites constructing particular localities. Student will propose primary schematic plan and model in the end of first semester.",
